      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁이네! 폭주 메가모단단게들의\n폭주 메가 결투를 멈춰 주게!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1C774B12400210020D3EDC8FC0020BA54AC00BAA8B2E8B2E8AC8CB4E4C758000AD3EDC8FC0020BA54AC000020ACB0D22CB97C0020BA48CDB00020C8FCAC8C0021002100100002011401D90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "폭주 메가모단단게들을 쓰러뜨려서\n폭주 메가 결투를 멈춰 주게!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
