      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건...\n모단단게나이트?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC74002E002E002E000ABAA8B2E8B2E8AC8CB098C774D2B8003F00100002011401D90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모단단게는 언제나 최고가 되려는 습성과\n눈앞에 있는 것을 때리고 보는 습성이 있지.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B2E8B2E8AC8CB2940020C5B8C81CB0980020CD5CACE0AC000020B418B824B2940020C2B5C131ACFC000AB208C55EC5D00020C788B2940020AC83C7440020B54CB9ACACE00020BCF4B2940020C2B5C131C7740020C788C9C0002E00100002011401D90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런 습성들이 폭주 메가 결투라는\n큰 소동으로 이어지게 한 걸지도 모르겠군...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F00020C2B5C131B4E4C7740020D3EDC8FC0020BA54AC000020ACB0D22CB77CB294000AD0700020C18CB3D9C73CB85C0020C774C5B4C9C0AC8C0020D55C0020AC78C9C0B3C40020BAA8B974ACA0AD70002E002E002E00100002011401D90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
